{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#1171","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#1171","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#1171\",\"parent_revision\":\"5a1ee536ca197257bd02a870ef37d7ec9e12d7ca497bd7db82734b8427151e43\",\"root_revision\":\"5a1ee536ca197257bd02a870ef37d7ec9e12d7ca497bd7db82734b8427151e43\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P1\\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-12\\n-->\\n\\n## Groomed (2026-04-15)\\n\\n### Priority\\n\\n7/10 - Malformed frontmatter silently breaks agent skill-loading at runtime. The three affected agents (code-reviewer, python-cli-architect, python-cli-design-spec) are the primary Python development agents in the plugin. Fix is mechanical once files are identified.\\n\\n### Impact\\n\\n- Blocks: Agents code-reviewer, python-cli-architect, and python-cli-design-spec may fail to load their declared skills at runtime, degrading output quality silently.\\n- Bottleneck: python-cli-architect is the primary implementation agent for the plugin. Degraded skill loading affects all Python CLI development tasks routed through it.\\n\\n### Benefits\\n\\n- Three agents load their declared skills correctly, producing higher-quality standards-aware outputs.\\n- skilllint pre-commit hook stops flagging these files on every commit.\\n- Removes risk of the auto-fix diverging from intent if someone runs --fix without review.\\n\\n### Expected Behavior\\n\\nThe skills: field in agent frontmatter is a comma-separated string. Claude Code parses this as a string, not a YAML list. Agents activate with declared skills pre-loaded.\\n\\n### Desired Structure\\n\\nAll three agent files pass \\\"uvx skilllint@latest check plugins/python3-development/agents/\\\" with zero frontmatter errors. Each file has its skills: field as a single-line comma-separated string with no YAML list markers (lines starting with \\\"  - \\\").\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n1. skilllint check on agents/code-reviewer.md exits 0.\\n2. skilllint check on agents/python-cli-architect.md exits 0.\\n3. skilllint check on agents/python-cli-design-spec.md exits 0.\\n4. No YAML list markers in the skills: field of any of the three files.\\n5. Pre-commit hook passes on commit after the fix.\\n\\n### Resources\\n\\nScript: plugins/plugin-creator/scripts/fix_tool_formats.py (auto-fixes YAML list to comma-separated string)\\nValidator: uvx skilllint@latest check --fix\\nRule: .claude/rules/frontmatter-requirements.md\\nFile: plugins/python3-development/agents/code-reviewer.md lines 6-13\\nFile: plugins/python3-development/agents/python-cli-architect.md lines 6-12\\nFile: plugins/python3-development/agents/python-cli-design-spec.md lines 5-6\\n\\n### Dependencies\\n\\n- Depends on: None\\n- Blocks: None identified\\n\\n### Effort\\n\\nSmall - three single-line YAML field rewrites, each confirmed by skilllint. Estimated 15 minutes total.\\n\\n### Blockers\\n\\nNone - all three files identified, fix path clear, validator available.\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **python3-development: fix 3 malformed frontmatter files** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Plugin code review session 2026-02-21\\n- **Priority**: completed\\n- **Added**: 2026-02-21\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"0e605dfa524e1f3021c3b17a3c99e8284e35e5f9bda72aab0814ed3a04b826b1\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPS86eA\"}"}